*     FAP                                                               READ)000
       ENTRY   READ)                                                    READ)010
* VARIABLE LENGTH, MIXED MODE, READ RECORD ROUTINE                      READ)020
*                                                                       READ)030
*                                                                       READ)040
*              CALLING SEQUENCE                                         READ)050
*              L   TSX $READ),4                                         READ)060
*              L+1 PZE A,0,T                                            READ)070
*              L+2 PZE 0,0,M                                            READ)080
*              L+3 PERMANENT REDUNDANCY                                 READ)090
*              L+4 NO SUCH TAPE                                         READ)100
*              L+5 END OF FILE                                          READ)110
*              L+6 BCD RECORD                                           READ)120
*              L+7 BIN RECORD                                           READ)130
*              A=LOADING LOCATION                                       READ)140
*              T=LOGICAL TAPE NO.                                       READ)150
*              M=MAXIMUM NO. OF WORDS TO BE LOADED.                     READ)160
*              ADDRESS OF AC CONTAINS NO. OF WORDS READ                 READ)170
*                                                                       READ)180
 READ) CLA     1,4                                                      READ)190
       STA     INPUT              INITIALIZE DATA LOCATION              READ)200
       STA     NUMWDS                                                   READ)210
       ARS     18                                                       READ)220
       TZE     4,4                NO SUCH TAPE                          READ)230
       SSP                                                              READ)240
       CAS     TAPEL                                                    READ)250
       TRA     4,4                NO SUCH TAPE                          READ)260
       NOP                                                              READ)270
       ADM     IOU                PICK UP PHYSICAL TAPE UNIT            READ)280
       STA     *+1                                                      READ)290
       CLA     **                                                       READ)300
       STA     BSR                                                      READ)310
       STA     RTD                                                      READ)320
       STD     IND                                                      READ)330
       ORA     L(20)              FOR BINARY SELECT                     READ)340
       STA     RTB                                                      READ)350
       CLA     2,4                                                      READ)360
       STD     INPUT              MAX. NO. OF WORDS                     READ)370
RDNCNT LDQ     MQ                 SET RUNDUNDANCY COUNT.                READ)380
       CLA     IND                                                      READ)390
       TZE     DLAYA                                                    READ)400
 DLAYB TCOB    *                  CHANNEL B-DELAY.                      READ)410
 OFFB  TRCB    *+1                TURN OFF CHB INDICATORS               READ)420
       TEFB    TEST                                                     READ)430
       TRA     TEST                                                     READ)440
 DLAYA TCOA    *                  CHANNEL A-DELAY.                      READ)450
 OFFA  TRCA    *+1                TURN OFF CHA INDICATORS               READ)460
       TEFA    TEST                                                     READ)470
 TEST  TMI     RTB                MINUS-BINARY, PLUS-BCD                READ)480
 RTD   RDS     **                                                       READ)490
       TRA     READ                                                     READ)500
 RTB   RDS     **                                                       READ)510
 READ  TZE     READA                                                    READ)520
 READB RCHB    INPUT              READ CHANNEL B                        READ)530
       TCOB    *                                                        READ)540
       TRCB    MODE               REDUNDANCY                            READ)550
       TEFB    5,4                END OF FILE EXIT                      READ)560
       SCHB    CHNL                                                     READ)570
       TRA     WDS                                                      READ)580
 READA RCHA    INPUT              READ CHANNEL A                        READ)590
       TCOA    *                                                        READ)600
       TRCA    MODE               REDUNDANCY                            READ)610
       TEFA    5,4                EOF EXIT                              READ)620
       SCHA    CHNL                                                     READ)630
 WDS   CAL     CHNL                                                     READ)640
       ANA     MASK                                                     READ)650
       SUB     NUMWDS                                                   READ)660
       LDQ     IND                                                      READ)670
       TQP     6,4                BCD EXIT                              READ)680
       TRA     7,4                BIN EXIT                              READ)690
 MODE  RQL     1                                                        READ)700
       TQP     CHS                TEST FOR MORE THAN 18 REDUNDANCIES.   READ)710
       SCHA    CHNL               PERMANENT REDUNDANCY.                 READ)720
       CAL     CHNL               COMPUTE WORD COUNT                    READ)730
       ANA     MASK                                                     READ)740
       SUB     NUMWDS                                                   READ)750
       CAS     TWO                                                      READ)760
       TRA     RDNCNT             NOISE RECORD.                         READ)770
       TRA     RDNCNT             NOISE RECORD.                         READ)780
       TRA     3,4                PERMANENT REDUNDANCY RETURN.          READ)790
 CHS   CHS                        CHANGE READ MODE.                     READ)800
       STO     IND                                                      READ)810
 BSR   BSR     **                 BACKSPACE RECORD                      READ)820
       TRA     TEST               REREAD                                READ)830
 INPUT IORT    **,0,**                                                  READ)840
 IOU   PZE     IOU                LOGICAL TAPES                         READ)850
 A1    OCT     000000001201       1                                     READ)860
 B2    OCT     000001002202       2                                     READ)870
 B3    OCT     000001002203       3                                     READ)880
 A4    OCT     000000001204       4                                     READ)890
 A2    OCT     000000001202       5                                     READ)900
 A3    OCT     000000001203       6                                     READ)910
 B4    OCT     000001002204       7                                     READ)920
 B1    OCT     000001002201       8                                     READ)930
 A5    OCT     000000001205       9                                     READ)940
 A6    OCT     000000001206       10                                    READ)950
 B5    OCT     000001002205       11                                    READ)960
 B6    OCT     000001002206       12                                    READ)970
 TAPEL PZE     TAPEL-IOU-1        NUMBER OF TAPES                       READ)980
 L(20) OCT     20                                                       READ)990
 IND   PZE                                                              READ)990
 MQ    PZE     0,0,1                                                    READ1000
 MASK  PZE     -1,0,0                                                   READ1010
 TWO   PZE     2                                                        READ1020
 CHNL  BSS     1                                                        READ1030
NUMWDS BSS     1                                                        READ1040
       END                                                              READ1050
